                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game cannot be played anymore, do not buy.\n\nLaunching the game displays a black screen with some text that says [b]Please check your network connection or try again later[/b]. This screen cannot be passed and the game is completely unplayable. This game has been offline since at least 2020.\n\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/id/1272152519/recommended/552230/]The developer confirmed the game requires a connection to run in 2017.[/url]\n\nI've also tried multiple depots (older versions of the steam build) without any luck.\n\nOther users that mention this issue:\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/app/552230/discussions/0/2242175653302564238/\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/id/disturbanceinthesource/recommended/552230/\n\n[table][tr][td]I test all types of VR games for my curator [u][url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/29354216]VR Achievement Hunters[/url][/u][/td][/tr][/table]",
